# =============================================================================
# Global defaults for EVERY host. Additive / keepalive keys only - nothing that
# overrides an identity, a user or a hostname.
#
# Included LAST by each machine's final config: OpenSSH takes the FIRST value
# it sees per keyword, so anything included earlier can still override these.
# =============================================================================
Host *
  ServerAliveInterval 60
  ServerAliveCountMax 3
  TCPKeepAlive yes
  Compression yes
  AddKeysToAgent yes
